"""Every unified lifecycle acceptance criterion has concrete evidence or an explicit active blocker."""
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-SYSTEM
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-SYSTEM
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-SYSTEM
